cmp - compare two files byte by byte

SYNOPSIS
    cmp file1 file2

DESCRIPTION
    Compare file1 with file2. Report the first differing byte, numbered from
    1, or the point at which the shorter file ends. Identical files produce
    no output.

EXIT STATUS
    The exit status is 0 for identical files, 1 for different files or 2 on
    error.

SEE ALSO
    cat(1), hexdump(1)
